Coordinate3D [SimTalk] - general description
Sets the 3D coordinate of the object designated by <Path>.
Remarks
The attribute is not inherited.
You cannot query the value of Coordinate3D for MU instances.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Coordinate3D:array
Assignment Value
You can assign an array of data type length with three values.
Example
MyStation.Coordinate3D := [-10, 11, 0]
print MyStation.Coordinate3D // returns [-10, 11, 0]
