Attributes of User-defined Attributes
_Attributes of User-defined Attributes
The objects provide the attributes listed in the table of contents to the left for working with their user-
defined attributes, which you define on the tab User-defined.
Plant Simulation addresses the attributes of user-defined attributes as sub-attributes of the respective
user-defined attribute.
MyStation.myAttribute.Alignment := "Left"
The window Show Attributes and Methods shows the user-defined attribute itself and its value.
