Sets the number of integer places, which the user-defined attribute of the object designated by <Path>
shows in 3D.
Remarks
The user-defined attribute can show up to 15 integer places.
The default setting -1 means that Plant Simulation applies no minimum on the number of integer places.
Specify a positive value to fill up the space before the decimal point with blank spaces until the specified
number of places has been reached if the user-defined attribute is shown in 3D.
