Sets if the user-defined attribute of the object designated by <Path> shows the units of the values (true)
or not (false) in the Frame into which you inserted it.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.<UserDefinedAttribute>.ShowUnit:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
MyStation.myAttribute.ShowUnit := true
See also
Show Units [user-defined attribute]
ShowUnit [SimTalk] - user-defined attribute
