StatisticsActive [SimTalk] - user-defined attribute
Sets if the user-defined attribute of the object designated by <Path> collects statistics values (true) or not
(false).
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.<UserDefinedAttribute>.StatisticsActive:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
MyStation.myAttribute.StatisticsActive := true
See also
